---
import { profile } from '../../data/profile';
import ActionLink from '../ui/ActionLink.astro';
---

<section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1 id="hero-title">{profile.valueProposition}</h1>
    <p>
      {profile.summary} Para PyMEs que necesitan integrar, automatizar o construir una herramienta
      propia.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <ActionLink href="#contacto">Hablemos de tu proyecto</ActionLink>
      <ActionLink href="#proyectos" variant="secondary">
        Ver casos demostrativos
      </ActionLink>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="process-plan" aria-label="Proceso de trabajo: comprender, intervenir y entregar">
    <div class="axis" aria-hidden="true">
      <span></span>
    </div>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <a href="#servicios">
          <span class="point">A</span>
          <strong>Proceso actual</strong>
          <small>Identificar la fricción</small>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="#experiencia">
          <span class="point">B</span>
          <strong>Intervención</strong>
          <small>Diseñar lo necesario</small>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="final-action" href="#contacto">
          <span class="point">C</span>
          <strong>Solicitar contacto</strong>
          <small>Construir un resultado útil</small>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="plan-note">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 18 18" width="18" height="18">
        <path d="M3 2v7a4 4 0 0 0 4 4h7M10 9l4 4-4 4" />
      </svg>
      <span>La solución empieza por entender el recorrido, no por elegir una tecnología.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    min-height: min(47rem, calc(100svh - 7rem));
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.95fr) minmax(26rem, 1.05fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 8rem);
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem);
  }
  h1 {
    max-width: 13ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6.3vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 570;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 0.93;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .hero-copy > p {
    max-width: 58ch;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.5vw, 1.35rem);
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    margin-top: 2.4rem;
  }
  .process-plan {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    background: rgb(237 240 235 / 0.7);
    padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }
  .process-plan::before,
  .process-plan::after {
    position: absolute;
    content: '';
    background: var(--color-rule);
  }
  .process-plan::before {
    top: -0.55rem;
    left: 2rem;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1.1rem;
  }
  .process-plan::after {
    top: 2rem;
    left: -0.55rem;
    width: 1.1rem;
    height: 1px;
  }
  .axis {
    position: absolute;
    top: 5.2rem;
    right: 3rem;
    left: 3rem;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--color-rule);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .axis span {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-plan);
    transform: scaleX(0.18);
    transform-origin: left;
    transition: transform 700ms var(--ease-out-expo);
  }
  .process-plan:has(li:nth-child(2) a:is(:hover, :focus-visible)) .axis span {
    transform: scaleX(0.55);
  }
  .process-plan:has(li:nth-child(3) a:is(:hover, :focus-visible)) .axis span {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }
  ol {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  li a {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: start;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .point {
    display: grid;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    place-items: center;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-plan);
    background: var(--color-paper);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    transition:
      background 160ms ease,
      color 160ms ease,
      scale 180ms var(--ease-out-expo);
  }
  li a:hover .point,
  li a:focus-visible .point {
    scale: 1.1;
    background: var(--color-plan);
    color: #fff;
  }
  strong {
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  small {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .final-action strong {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-mark);
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 0.35rem;
  }
  .final-action .point {
    background: var(--color-ink);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .plan-note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    max-width: 35ch;
    margin: 4rem 0 0 auto;
    color: var(--color-plan-dark);
    font-weight: 620;
  }
  .plan-note svg {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-mark);
    stroke-linecap: square;
    stroke-linejoin: miter;
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }
  @media (max-width: 63.99rem) {
    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .process-plan {
      max-width: 48rem;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 35rem) {
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 14vw, 4rem);
    }
    .hero-actions {
      align-items: stretch;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .process-plan {
      padding: 1.2rem;
    }
    .axis {
      top: 3.75rem;
      right: 2rem;
      left: 2rem;
    }
    ol {
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }
    strong {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
    }
    small {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
    .plan-note {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
